You should be pretty soon.  As soon as you ID ?ea.  Getting magic
marker and writing a bunch of ?ea is high-priority.

Magicbane + Eye (assuming that's safe--I believe it is) seems like the
best way out of the shop w/o wasting a wish on a wand. Jumping boots
next.  Then you have outs for most situations: Magicbane's Elbereth for
most things, jumping away for elves, etc, and invoking the eye to
airlift out (visiting sokoban becomes a high priority so you have a
place to airlift to since minetown is off limits for a good while).

Save one charge (the wrest) for "oR if Sokoban lacks it, and you may
have as many as 2 more wishes for a marker (two if sokoban is good to
you) and helm of brilliance.  And then finding ?enchant armor is your
high priority.

The jumping boots are a solution for medusa and Castle, too, so you're
setting yourself up to have the tools you need to get that next
/wishing.

Of course, if your first wish is the wrest I guess you gotta go for
/poly or /death, risking the Eye's blast seems foolish.  /poly would be
my choice.  If the 2nd wish is the wrest, early Magicbane+Eye is a good
haul and leaves you with Elbereth and airlift (and MR!) to get out of
danger.

